  "reasoning": "The defendant organized and participated in multiple large‑scale illegal logging operations, knowingly cutting trees that did not belong to him, selling the stolen timber and distributing the proceeds. This conduct constitutes the crime of illegal logging and destruction of forest resources under Article 322 of the Criminal Law, commonly termed “非法采伐、毁坏森林资源罪”. No other distinct offenses (e.g., theft, fraud) are indicated beyond this specific illegal forest resource crime.",
